    "shared": "Existing MLP, Adam, batch-class-balanced CE, task order and 200/class maximum retained. New corrections are borrowed controls, not proposed mechanisms.",
    "ssil": "Separated old/new CE and taskwise old KL, with64 additional old replay rows per base batch. Original LwF/RCL/DER++ auxiliary losses retained as an explicit stacked adaptation. Single-class task softmax CE/KL is identically zero. Additional replay exposure recorded.",
    "wa": "Mean L2 norm ratio scales latest-task weights and biases after each incremental task; no positive-weight clamp; original base losses retained."
